OL,3,AParis closes metro stations as France
OL,4,Abraces for further mass protests
OL,5,
OL,6,FMajor demonstrations are planned in
OL,7,FFrance again following weeks of
OL,8,Fviolence and unrest
OL,10,FShopfronts are boarded up, some tourist
OL,11,Fspots are shut and Paris has closed a
OL,12,Fnumber of metro stations
OL,14,FIt follows last weekend's riots and
OL,15,Flooting that impacted thousands of
OL,16,Fbusinesses and saw more than 2,700
OL,17,Farrested
OL,19,FCurfews, closures and protest bans are
OL,20,Fin place in cities including Paris,
OL,21,FMarseille and Lyon - although some
OL,22,Fdemonstrations are being allowed
